<item>
<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-02T18:37:28.964Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:37:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue in Manipur as Kuki volunteers were shot dead and five Kuki men were found mutilated in gunny bags, prompting protests in Kangpokpi and Noney and police responses with tear gas and batons. In Chhattisgarh security forces recovered arms, explosives and Maoist communication equipment from a forest dump in Kanker, indicating ongoing anti-Maoist operations. A road accident in Reasi, Jammu and Kashmir killed one person and injured two. The conflict now combines ethnic violence in Manipur, Maoist security actions in Chhattisgarh, and a separate accident in Kashmir, while 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;News18&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxObWd3U2t3TW81cVZNWEdjMkdDVkxBMVJKQWhUb1E3NWJ4RXZ4T3dnUTVEQlBYMXBOTjFQVDJLNDZKcHBqNHpqSE5MRjJjb3oybk9LbFJqczVhUXFCOTlJQU9xZy1nN2lnWW41SFdYc0YybG55QXZiVXR2M0dmbVFBU19MYXRKSHdfYmJGWUQ5RExBS19h?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NDTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNOXUwamtta0RLak1GRnlwZ2x1OFpiUm5zWW1INktJYVE3N2RPczE0dElkZTdnNzhqZDhCLTR0V2FoQVlMdDFDNHhLNHNkanE2OHVsa1oyMjhSVEswb29sdmZGVnJsTEVNSDBDSG1pN2g2TkoyOUtYZ0doSVdyTkhsTG56dUFqSVp1OWVaUUhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPYWtGbE5SdWRDSExmZDEtQkpvVjdOS3FsakFXbUhWLTluQ